  "body": "A consistency/release pass over the whole project after the Gen-4 merge, creation-doc alignment, `schedule_pulse`, and the two demos' functional rebuild.\n\n## Version \u2192 unified at **4.5.0**\nWas split across files (`3.0.0` in pyproject, `4.0.0` in `__init__`, `v2.3` stamps on five conceptual docs, `v3.0` historical):\n- `pyproject.toml` `3.0.0 \u2192 4.5.0` (+ description \"v3\" \u2192 \"Gen-4\")\n- `mantle/__init__.py` `__version__ 4.0.0 \u2192 4.5.0`\n- five `**Mantle OS v2.3**` stamps \u2192 `**Mantle OS \u00b7 Gen-4**` (Doctrine, Extensions, Organism_Lens, Organ_Atlas, VCW_Tiers)\n\nThe **Gen-4** generation codename is unchanged; **4.5.0** is the semver for this release. The cube format id `vcw-cube-png-v2` is deliberately left as-is (unchanged through Gen-4).\n\n## Cross-reference sweep \u2014 no orphan links or references\nEvery internal markdown link in the repo now resolves, and no current doc references a non-existent path.\n- Stale pre-merge paths \u2192 canonical `mantle/` homes (`body.py`\u2192`mantle/core/body.py`, `mind.py`\u2192`mantle/mind/mind.py`, `organs/nervous.py`\u2192`mantle/organs/nervous.py`, `drivers.py`\u2192`mantle/vcw/drivers.py`, `lineage.py::Cube.compact`\u2192`mantle/vcw/cube.py`, `lineage.py::standard_genome`\u2192`mantle/vcw/bands.py`, `skills.py`\u2192`mantle/mind/inner_voice.py`). Valid `examples/vcw` refs (`vcw_cube.py`, `audit.py`, `GUIDE.md`) kept.\n- Fixed broken relative links in `docs/` (root-relative paths missing the `../` prefix).\n- Refreshed now-stale prose: PRIMER + README + `examples/README` no longer call the HTML/YAML examples \"v2-era / not regenerated\" \u2014 they're Gen-4-aligned and the two HTML demos functionally implement + browser-test the four organ behaviors.\n\nHistorical docs (`docs/Mantle_v3_*`, `docs/v3/*`) are intentionally left as the sealed Gen-3 reference.\n\n## GitHub cleanliness\nAlready clean \u2014 `.gitignore` excludes `desktop.ini` / `__pycache__` / `*.pyc` / `*.vcw` / OS cruft, and **nothing junk is tracked** (the desktop.ini/pycache seen locally are Drive-injected/Python-generated and never reach GitHub).\n\n## Verified\n`import mantle` \u2192 `4.5.0`; `python -m mantle prove` \u2192 **67/67 invariants green** (incl. DOCTOR-1 docs-vs-code coherence); all markdown links resolve repo-wide.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
